  <RatkinUnderground.RKU_DialogueEventDef>
    <defName>RKU_ResearchReward_Assault</defName>
    <dialogueText>      感谢你们的协助！我们完成了一些突击武器蓝图的初步整理，
现在我们将会把这些蓝图分享给你们的研究员，并且充实我们自己的武装。</dialogueText>
    <priority>10</priority>
    <triggerOnce>true</triggerOnce>
	  <triggerOnStartup>true</triggerOnStartup>
    <conditions>
      <li Class="RatkinUnderground.DialogueCondition_ResearchGrade">
        <requiredGrade>1</requiredGrade>
      </li>
    </conditions>
    <actions>
      <li Class="RatkinUnderground.DialogueAction_SpawnTechprint">
        <researchDefName>RKU_UndergroundAssaultWeapons</researchDefName>
        <count>1</count>
      </li>
    </actions>
  </RatkinUnderground.RKU_DialogueEventDef>
  
  <RatkinUnderground.RKU_DialogueEventDef>
    <defName>RKU_ResearchReward_Guerrilla</defName>
    <dialogueText>      我们会把我们的装备制造方法与你们共享，虽然是些破烂货，
但它们都是在长年的斗争中被检验过的好东西。</dialogueText>
    <priority>11</priority>
    <triggerOnce>true</triggerOnce>
	<triggerOnStartup>true</triggerOnStartup>
    <conditions>
      <li Class="RatkinUnderground.DialogueCondition_ResearchGrade">
        <requiredGrade>2</requiredGrade>
      </li>
    </conditions>
    <actions>
      <li Class="RatkinUnderground.DialogueAction_SpawnTechprint">
        <researchDefName>RKU_UndergroundGuerrillaEquipments</researchDefName>
        <count>1</count>
      </li>
    </actions>
  </RatkinUnderground.RKU_DialogueEventDef>
  
  <RatkinUnderground.RKU_DialogueEventDef>
    <defName>RKU_ResearchReward_Experimental</defName>
    <dialogueText>      最新的地下实验武器的蓝图已经被同步到你们那边了，
朋友们。我们刚刚完成了这些武器装备的可行性分析，但实际应用还得经过进一步的检验和测试。
到时候就请你们来锻造第一批武器原型了。</dialogueText>
    <priority>12</priority>
    <triggerOnce>true</triggerOnce>
	<triggerOnStartup>true</triggerOnStartup>
    <conditions>
      <li Class="RatkinUnderground.DialogueCondition_ResearchGrade">
        <requiredGrade>3</requiredGrade>
      </li>
    </conditions>
    <actions>
      <li Class="RatkinUnderground.DialogueAction_SpawnTechprint">
        <researchDefName>RKU_UndergroundExperimentalWeapon</researchDefName>
        <count>1</count>
      </li>
    </actions>
  </RatkinUnderground.RKU_DialogueEventDef>
  
  <RatkinUnderground.RKU_DialogueEventDef>
    <defName>RKU_ResearchReward_Experimental2</defName>
    <dialogueText>      很好，验证结果很不错，这些武器想必能在之后的战斗
中大放光彩。制造这些原型武器的材料需要在地下寻找，
而成品的威力会让你的所有敌人喝上一壶！实战测试也拜托你们那边了！</dialogueText>
    <priority>13</priority>
    <triggerOnce>true</triggerOnce>
	<triggerOnStartup>true</triggerOnStartup>
    <conditions>
      <li Class="RatkinUnderground.DialogueCondition_ResearchGrade">
